"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T04:46:47-08:00","id":363356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=363285#post363285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, please tell?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I am thinking of giving the The Patriarch Inarnae as their tribal totem. Would make them the only tribe that have a strictly weaver-spirit as such. Thinking of making them a Male dominant tribe, putting them directly at odds with the Black Furies. Historically they began somewhere in Egypt with the Striders and (if you believe them) Bone Gnawers, migrated out with the Hebrews hence they have been serving the One God for as long as humans can remember. They spread out of the middle east into Rome through the adoption of Christianity. This will have put them in direct contest with the Glasswalkers and Silver Fang of the time. Their presence in the Americas was slower then the other European tribes. While the others started going their, the DC choose to strengthen their presence in Europe, as such they never establish a very strong foot hold in the Americas though they do have a presence.<br /> <br /> I have a couple gifts ideas but nothing concrete yet. Most so far replenish willpower, channel rage, or help them carry out judgement on those that they have feel broken the &quot;natural law&quot;.<br /> <br /> Sound anything like what you were envisioning?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T06:13:51-08:00","id":368557,"title":"","content":"So Domini Canis is proving harder then expected. I am having a hard time working them in without stepping on the Stargazers or CoG. Anyone else still working on anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T06:40:30-08:00","id":368566,"title":"","content":"I started my early glass Walker, unfortunately I have to do something for work...so it got put on the backburner.<br /> <br /> But they should be interesting","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"htt